  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Lawrence F. DeGeorge is an American investor who built a long career in telecommunications and technology finance. After senior operating roles at Amphenol, including president, he directed venture-capital investments through LPL entities, chaired fibre-network provider CompleTel and backed data-centre operator Cervalis. He also co-founded a children-focused charitable foundation in Florida.",
